WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Apple Watch scoreboard with a simulated heart-rate reading of 126 beats per minute. Each point flips with sound.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Both players reach 40 points while the set score stays visible.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Deuce: 40–40.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Advantage changes sides as play continues.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Deuce returns, then You gain Advantage again.
